Copyright 2025 KonghaYao and Peri contributors

This repository contains the end-to-end test suite of the Peri project
(https://github.com/KonghaYao/peri), imported under the Apache License 2.0.
The imported Peri revision is recorded in PROVENANCE.md.

Modifications relative to the imported sources: the suite now lives at the
repository root, path resolution is repository-relative and driven by
PERI_SOURCE_ROOT / PERI_BINARY, and tui-tester is vendored as a local npm
workspace package. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for third-party components.
